  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice the red onion. Finely chop the garlic.\n• Roughly chop the tomato. Chop the cauliflower into small florets. Slice the lemon into wedges.\n• Rinse the red lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603c1c67f3e82260eb5eca88/step-11836ea6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add the red onion and cook until softened, 3-5 minutes. Add the garlic, tomato, tomato paste and mild North Indian spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• TIP: Frying the tomato paste deepens its flavour.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603c1c67f3e82260eb5eca88/step-f96f2432.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the red lentils, water, honey and vegetable stock pot. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer. Cover with a lid or foil and cook, stirring occasionally, until the lentils are softened, 20-22 minutes. Add the baby spinach leaves, stir until wilted and season to taste. Remove from the heat.\n• TIP: Add a little water if the lentils look dry.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603c1c67f3e82260eb5eca88/step-1b16b240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the lentils are cooking, combine the turmeric (see ingredients), the salt, a squeeze of lemon juice, 1/2 the Greek-style yoghurt and a drizzle of olive oil in a medium bowl. Add the cauliflower florets, toss until well coated and season with pepper. Transfer to a lined oven tray and roast for 15-20 minutes.\n• TIP: The cauliflower will char slightly, this adds to the flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603c1c67f3e82260eb5eca88/step-0b065cd3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the cauliflower is roasting, finely chop the cucumber. Pick and roughly chop the mint. In a second medium bowl, combine the cucumber, remaining Greek-style yoghurt and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603c1c67f3e82260eb5eca88/step-b4687d24.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop the roasted cashews. Divide the mild North Indian lentils between bowls. Top with the turmeric roasted cauliflower and cucumber raita. Garnish with the mint and cashews.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603c1c67f3e82260eb5eca88/step-0ed769bb.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
